{"assets":["/statement-assets/19931f9ab08e8fb0da03c7704728a1ac2020ac7893a59ad1cbb84104b62a1ebb.png","/statement-assets/94a0374b2118c4ded105adc3a8ec4d4edd301cb7e38f2b0258c0f4a9211005e2.png","/statement-assets/658fa2ce81d1c089f1dc5f1272fa52d1487279d13dce6c87bc14072229b48a4f.png","/statement-assets/93605d85dc72a6bce55e187c0587f5fa33c02928b26aeecb06c65a5dfbb9989d.png","/statement-assets/b3f2f2ad5f04b8d8ce85c83cde460ae1049beea65a0d0b63bce138ff57c274ba.png","/statement-assets/eb0f1c352a2d421b8016f29a4924b6293e497ed256227b9b64635c506b362f92.png","/statement-assets/9ffe2c0c7a6d00f3d8a73366c8eca591ea620ff9b2595aea6d099e7ae9e4b039.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1002","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A2. Generate superposition of zero state and a basis state"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"N"},{"kind":"text","text":" qubits ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ N ≤ 8"},{"kind":"text","text":") in zero state "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/19931f9ab08e8fb0da03c7704728a1ac2020ac7893a59ad1cbb84104b62a1ebb.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":". You are also given a bitstring "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"bits"},{"kind":"text","text":" which describes a non-zero basis state on "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"N"},{"kind":"text","text":" qubits "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/94a0374b2118c4ded105adc3a8ec4d4edd301cb7e38f2b0258c0f4a9211005e2.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Your task is to generate a state which is an equal superposition of "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/19931f9ab08e8fb0da03c7704728a1ac2020ac7893a59ad1cbb84104b62a1ebb.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":" and the given basis state:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/658fa2ce81d1c089f1dc5f1272fa52d1487279d13dce6c87bc14072229b48a4f.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You have to implement an operation which takes the following inputs:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" an array of qubits "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"qs"},{"kind":"text","text":","}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" an arrays of boolean values "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"bits"},{"kind":"text","text":" representing the basis state "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/94a0374b2118c4ded105adc3a8ec4d4edd301cb7e38f2b0258c0f4a9211005e2.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":". This array will have the same length as the array of qubits. The first element of this array "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"bits[0]"},{"kind":"text","text":" will be "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"true"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The operation doesn't have an output; its \"output\" is the state in which it leaves the qubits."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"An array of boolean values represents a basis state as follows: the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th element of the array is true if the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th qubit is in state "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/93605d85dc72a6bce55e187c0587f5fa33c02928b26aeecb06c65a5dfbb9989d.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":", and false if it is in state "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/b3f2f2ad5f04b8d8ce85c83cde460ae1049beea65a0d0b63bce138ff57c274ba.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":". For example, array "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"[true; false]"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" describes 2-qubit state "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/eb0f1c352a2d421b8016f29a4924b6293e497ed256227b9b64635c506b362f92.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":", and in this case the resulting state should be "},{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/9ffe2c0c7a6d00f3d8a73366c8eca591ea620ff9b2595aea6d099e7ae9e4b039.png"},"kind":"image"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Your code should have the following signature:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"namespace Solution {\n    open Microsoft.Quantum.Primitive;\n    open Microsoft.Quantum.Canon;\n\n    operation Solve (qs : Qubit[], bits : Bool[]) : ()\n    {\n        body\n        {\n            // your code here\n        }\n    }\n}"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A2","problemCode":"1002A2","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1002/problem/A2"}